| Speed: the hd clip without checksums (-t). First vcdec 0.4's defaults (a
| cacheable pool, LDM 8) with the copy on its own timed each way (-K); then
| 0.3's defaults (PCI memory, LDM 4), PCI memory with LDM 8 (the fallback),
| the defaults with 6 buffers, and with each transfer waited for (-S). Each
| run says where the time inside vcdec went. Reports to ResultT.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultT
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -K -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -m pci -c ldm4 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -m pci -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -B 6 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -S -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
